## Key Results for Your Presentation

- **Dataset**: 11,885 samples × 256 spectral channels, 4 polymer classes
- **Model**: 1D-CNN with 265,476 parameters (2 conv layers + 2 FC layers)
- **Test Accuracy**: **99%** on held-out 20% test set
- **Per-class**: PET=100%, PE=99.3%, PS=98.8%, PP=97.2%
- **5-Fold CV**: Mean 98.12% (SD=1.80%)
- **Overfitting Risk**: LOW (train-val loss gap = 0.0226)
- **Data Leakage**: 0 duplicate rows
- **Inference Speed**: ~0.4ms per sample

## Suggested 20-min Presentation Flow

1. **Problem & Motivation** (3 min) — microplastic detection challenge
2. **Dataset Overview** (2 min) — use `01_dataset_class_distribution.png` + `02_sample_spectra.png`
3. **Model Architecture** (3 min) — use `03_model_architecture.txt` + ONNX diagram from `project documents/`
4. **Training** (3 min) — use `04_training_curves.png` (show convergence)
5. **Results** (5 min) — use `05_confusion_matrix.png` + `06_classification_report.txt` + `07_per_class_accuracy.png`
6. **Robustness** (2 min) — use `08_cross_validation.png` + `09_learning_curves_cv.png`
7. **Live Demo + Conclusion** (2 min) — run [03_test_model.py](file:///c:/Users/Abhayditya%20Singh/Desktop/MINOR%20PROJECT/03_test_model.py) live or show `10_live_inference_demo.txt`
